# Numbers and expressions read from English (src/nlp.c).  Number words,
# fractions, mixed numbers, scale words, powers, roots, factorials,
# units and the arithmetic words around them.

# words and digits, mixed freely
what is 2 to the 10th?
what is two hundred fifty-six divided by 4?
what is ten thousand minus one?
what is 1 million divided by 1000?
what is 2.5 million plus 1?
what is 1e3 plus 1?
what is 0.1 plus 0.2?
what is 1.5 times 4?
what is 0x2a times 2?
what is 0b1111 plus 0b1?
what is negative three squared?
what is minus 5 plus 8?
what is 3 plus 4 times 2?
what is 9 minus 10?
what is minus 3 times minus 4?

# fractions, percentages and "of"
