what is the nearest integer to -2.5?

# factorials
what is 7 factorial?
what is the factorial of 6?
what is 5!?
what is 10 factorial divided by 8 factorial?
what is 4! / 2!?

# integers: gcd, lcm, remainder, quotient
what is the gcd of 84 and 36?
